      licenseUrl: "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Howard_Hughes.jpg",
      attribution: "Library of Congress, Prints & Photographs Division, reproduction number LC-USZ62-63333. Hughes standing in front of his Boeing 100A Army Pursuit Plane, Inglewood, California, 1940s.",
